<mxCell id="sc1_fan_79" value="Fan-out: module 0 = 10. Fan-in: U1 = 10, U6 = 10, U3 = 7, U2 = 5, U4 = 5, U5 = 3.&lt;br&gt;U4 Evaluate Alerts is called by modules 3 to 6 after saves and by 8 on the first dashboard request of the day (no cron). Module 7 owns rule evaluation detail (page 2)." style="html=1;shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="900" width="820" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
